+    /**
+     * The network info permission.
+     * A refused app gets the WifiInfo an app without location, local MAC and
+     * settings permissions gets, without the link: RSSI invalid, link speeds, frequency and
+     * Wi-Fi standard unknown, no IP address, security type and MLO links. The supplicant
